      "text": "| Symbol      | Meaning                                                                                                        |\n| ----------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **\\(W\\)**   | **Time-warp parameter**: maximum distance, in time steps, that the selected point can be warped left or right. |\n| **\\(F\\)**   | **Frequency-mask parameter**: maximum width of a frequency mask, in mel-frequency channels.                    |\n| **\\(m_F\\)** | Number of **frequency masks** applied.                                                                         |\n| **\\(T\\)**   | **Time-mask parameter**: maximum width of a time mask, in time steps.                                          |\n| **\\(p\\)**   | Maximum time-mask width as a **fraction of the total utterance length**.                                       |\n| **\\(m_T\\)** | Number of **time masks** applied.                                                                              |\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| Symbol      | Meaning                                                                                                        |\n| ----------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **\\(W\\)**   | **Time-warp parameter**: maximum distance, in time steps, that the selected point can be warped left or right. |\n| **\\(F\\)**   | **Frequency-mask parameter**: maximum width of a frequency mask, in mel-frequency channels.                    |\n| **\\(m_F\\)** | Number of **frequency masks** applied.                                                                         |\n| **\\(T\\)**   | **Time-mask parameter**: maximum width of a time mask, in time steps.                                          |\n| **\\(p\\)**   | Maximum time-mask width as a **fraction of the total utterance length**.                                       |\n| **\\(m_T\\)** | Number of **time masks** applied.                                                                              |\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
