    {
      "id": "4Mkj0QrfEZJ2G5Hw41q9N",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1237.7968076157413,
      "y": 1901.3270475434747,
      "width": 224.53292846679688,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "b0S_g4vQSzUUhB1DsNmcI",
        "GhAvIMJ6VNLvmrKMsDr1M"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0lV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 837227756,
      "version": 301,
      "versionNonce": 14836460,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789251349984,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Distil-Large-v3.5",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Distil-Large-v3.5",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Z4XbHqysVumbKt3ssnr0f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 901.624368040546,
      "y": 1973.7106992768731,
      "width": 934.6541748046875,
      "height": 550,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "kj53c2KXzblh9oi748H_G",
        "tty4EZon7816f3qia6jsy",
        "GhAvIMJ6VNLvmrKMsDr1M"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0m",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1619648236,
      "version": 1442,
      "versionNonce": 1122968940,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789251349984,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Distil-Whisper is the knowledge-distilled version of OpenAI's Whisper-Large-v3 Compared to\nearlier models, Distil-Large-v3.5 has been trained on over 4× more diverse public data (98k\nhours) and uses a \"patient\" teacher with an extended training schedule and aggressive data\naugmentation (SpecAugment) during distillation.\n\n\nModel        Params / M        Rel. RTFx        Short-Form OOD WER        Long-Form OOD\nWER\nlarge-v3-turbo        809        1.0        7.30        10.25\ndistil-large-v3        756        1.44        7.53        11.6\ndistil-large-v3.5        756        1.46        7.08        11.39\n\n\nWhy consider Distil-Large-v3.5 when Whisper-Large-v3-Turbo already exists?\n\nIt offers a different balance between accuracy and efficiency, remains ~1.5x faster than\nWhisper-Large-v3-Turbo while performing slightly better on short-form transcription and falling\n~1% behind on long-form transcription.\nIt works perfectly as a draft model for speculative decoding with Whisper-Large-v3. By keeping\nthe encoder frozen during training, we need to load just two extra decoder layers and forward\nthe encoder only once. This achieves ~2x faster inference compared to Whisper-Large-v3 while\nmaintaining identical outputs.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Distil-Whisper is the knowledge-distilled version of OpenAI's Whisper-Large-v3 Compared to earlier models, Distil-Large-v3.5 has been trained on over 4× more diverse public data (98k hours) and uses a \"patient\" teacher with an extended training schedule and aggressive data augmentation (SpecAugment) during distillation.\n\n\nModel        Params / M        Rel. RTFx        Short-Form OOD WER        Long-Form OOD WER\nlarge-v3-turbo        809        1.0        7.30        10.25\ndistil-large-v3        756        1.44        7.53        11.6\ndistil-large-v3.5        756        1.46        7.08        11.39\n\n\nWhy consider Distil-Large-v3.5 when Whisper-Large-v3-Turbo already exists?\n\nIt offers a different balance between accuracy and efficiency, remains ~1.5x faster than Whisper-Large-v3-Turbo while performing slightly better on short-form transcription and falling ~1% behind on long-form transcription.\nIt works perfectly as a draft model for speculative decoding with Whisper-Large-v3. By keeping the encoder frozen during training, we need to load just two extra decoder layers and forward the encoder only once. This achieves ~2x faster inference compared to Whisper-Large-v3 while maintaining identical outputs.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "iFckGZQYAjuWXZ8oqz1AV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 781.0520000457764,
      "y": 2684.134518623352,
      "width": 175.2247314453125,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "45n-F1xZYFG1WM6kCdXvl"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
